libautuni is the drawing code shared by the programs of the AutumnBSD
desktop, such as the login screen of Akture.  It draws with pixman into
images in memory, shapes with antialiased edges and text with FreeType,
and puts them on X windows through MIT-SHM.  It also maps backgrounds
in the .akbg format and parses configuration files.

It is a static library, which programs find with pkg-config as autuni.
